      "content": "I hear the deep exhaustion you are feeling, and it is completely understandable to consider giving up when you feel trapped in a painful loop. However, even if you don't feel you can \"get out\" right now, you do not have to give up on yourself forever, no matter how hopeless the day feels. Please consider reaching out to a trusted therapist or a suicide prevention helpline so you can explore these heavy feelings with a professional who can help you find support.",
